# MiniEngine test asset — hand-authored square pyramid (non-copyright, §14.6).
# RH coordinates, CCW outward winding (matches engine CULL_BACK + FrontCounterClockwise=TRUE).
# Normals intentionally omitted -> baker's aiProcess_GenSmoothNormals path is exercised.
v -1 -1 -1
v  1 -1 -1
v  1 -1  1
v -1 -1  1
v  0  1  0
# side faces (apex = v5), CCW outward
f 4 3 5
f 3 2 5
f 2 1 5
f 1 4 5
# base (-Y), CCW outward when viewed from below
f 1 2 3
f 1 3 4
